      "note": "Each major allegation (reclassification denial, harassment incidents, meeting exclusions, favoritism) is anchored to specific dates, witness statements, and documentary references (e.g., 'IR 203, 212' for reclassification requests; 'IR 205-06' for harassment incidents)."
